YxaW5XNzd3dXNGTzdnelM4S1hyZnNsRWJkNEt0OS1KWG8?oc=5","date":"2026-10-12","zh":"Viatris：信心增強再次推動併購行動（納斯達克股票代碼：VTRS）"},{"title":"Viatris’ Pacira Deal, Coca-Cola’s Costa Review And Devon’s Asset Sale: Three Corporate Moves To Watch","src":"Stocktwits","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxQNHpLR3V5WmNMS3lVNzJ3Mkt6ZlU2NU9ia1BQRzNsMGxIMVQ3bmE3ZTNHOFBQYTd0RkdUSmlpLVkzOUdPZlF6N2dmSUpKSWg4b19KRFBJc1g4WUxFZTJtWVd1U1IyaU96bHNLa1lpSC1mV2JiM2tKZkIxbHFveTRXNjdubUFURWlIM3h2Yk1QRXREd2xpVjNuSVdRLU5XQ3Z6aFoxcnVYNEtFb2FxSGRxZW5lMTRCbzV3YUUtQW1QRWN2Zk9YckwzSQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-11","zh":"Viatris 的 Pacira 交易、可口可樂的 Costa Review 和 Devon 的資產出售：值得關注的三項企業舉措"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-26","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1792044/000179204426000013/vtrs-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Viatris is a global healthcare company whose breadth and scale we believe make it uniquely positioned to address healthcare needs globally. With a mission to empower people worldwide to live healthier at every stage of life, Viatris supplies high-quality medicines to approximately 1 billion patients around the world each year. The Company has a global footprint, an extensive portfolio of medicines that is well-diversified across therapeutic areas, a one-of-a-kind global supply chain designed to reach more people when and where they need them, and the scientific expertise to address some of the world's most enduring health challenges.","zh":"Viatris 是一家全球醫療保健公司，我們相信其廣度和規模使其在滿足全球醫療保健需求方面具有獨特的優勢。 Viatris 的使命是讓全世界的人們在生命的每個階段都過得更健康，每年為全球約 10 億名患者提供高品質的藥品。該公司業務遍及全球，擁有跨治療領域多樣化的廣泛藥品組合、旨在隨時隨地為更多需要的人提供服務的獨一無二的全球供應鏈，以及解決世界上一些最持久的健康挑戰的科學專業知識。"},{"en":"Viatris' executive management team is focused on ensuring that the Company is optimally structured and efficiently resourced to deliver sustainable value to patients, shareholders, customers and other key stakeholders. The Company operates in more than 165 countries and territories with more than 30,000 employees. The Company has 27 manufacturing, packaging, and distribution sites worldwide, more than 1,400 approved molecules, and what we believe is industry leading commercial, R&D, regulatory, manufacturing, legal and medical expertise. Viatris' portfolio consists of generics (including complex products), globally recognized iconic brands, and an expanding portfolio of innovative medicines. Viatris is headquartered in the U.S., with global centers in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, Shanghai, China and Hyderabad, India.","zh":"Viatris 的執行管理團隊致力於確保公司實現最佳結構和有效資源配置，為病患、股東、客戶和其他主要利害關係人提供永續價值。該公司在超過 165 個國家和地區開展業務，擁有超過 30,000 名員工。該公司在全球擁有 27 個製造、包裝和分銷基地，擁有超過 1,400 種經批准的分子，以及我們認為領先業界的商業、研發、監管、製造、法律和醫療專業知識。 Viatris 的產品組合包括仿製藥（包括複雜產品）、全球公認的標誌性品牌以及不斷擴大的創新藥物組合。 Viatris 總部位於美國，在賓州匹茲堡、中國上海和印度海得拉巴設有全球中心。"},{"en":"We believe that Viatris' ability to sustainably deliver high-quality medicines is grounded in its mission to empower people worldwide to live healthier at every stage of life.","zh":"我們相信，Viatris 可持續提供高品質藥品的能力是基於其讓全世界人民在生命的每個階段都過得更健康的使命。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Developed Markets","val":8552100000,"zh":"已開發市場部門"},{"name":"Greater China","val":2332500000,"zh":"大中華區"},{"name":"Emerging Markets","val":2217600000,"zh":"新興市場部門"},{"name":"Japan Australia & New Zealand","val":1197700000,"zh":"日本、澳洲和紐西蘭部門"}],"total":14299900000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Brands","val":9184000000,"zh":"品牌"},{"name":"Generics","val":5066400000,"zh":"泛型"},{"name":"Lipitor","val":1549300000,"zh":"立普妥"},{"name":"Norvasc","val":709900000,"zh":"諾華克"},{"name":"Lyrica","val":487000000,"zh":"抒情詩"},{"name":"Epi Pen Auto Injectors","val":469700000,"zh":"Epi 筆自動注射器"},{"name":"Viagra","val":408200000,"zh":"威而鋼"},{"name":"Creon","val":365800000,"zh":"克瑞翁"},{"name":"Celebrex","val":272900000,"zh":"西樂